00:04:21.469 --> 00:04:23.767
if you start thinking about
this like a food product,

00:04:23.767 --> 00:04:26.260
it might change the way
people think about it.

00:04:26.260 --> 00:04:28.532
A lot more people eat food than drink wine

00:04:28.532 --> 00:04:30.505
