00:04:33.361 --> 00:04:34.453
I don't think you can pull it off.

00:04:34.453 --> 00:04:37.332
I don't think you can get
people to really understand

00:04:37.332 --> 00:04:40.071
that a beverage is a food
or thinking about it.

00:04:40.071 --> 00:04:42.217
You can make 'em take it
more seriously a la coffee,

00:04:42.217 --> 00:04:44.326
a la wine, you see what's going on

00:04:44.326 --> 00:04:45.923
in brown spirits right now.

00:04:45.923 --> 00:04:47.363
We can make them, you know,

00:04:47.363 --> 00:04:49.848
think about wine in a more complicated way

00:04:49.848 --> 00:04:51.620
and a more perplex way.

00:04:51.620 --> 00:04:53.609
The problem is, that's
where I think wine is.

00:04:53.609 --> 00:04:55.258
I think people actually think about wine

00:04:55.258 --> 00:04:57.248
more carefully than they think about food

00:04:57.248 --> 00:04:59.182
which is, in essence, your point, right?

00:04:59.182 --> 00:05:01.271
If we can make people
less intimidated about it

00:05:01.271 --> 00:05:02.847
and think of it as a more casual,

00:05:02.847 --> 00:05:04.267
as a standard within food.

00:05:04.267 --> 00:05:07.186
I mean, the way the wine
business wants you to think

00:05:07.186 --> 00:05:10.182
is that this is always at
the table when you're eating

00:05:10.182 --> 00:05:12.131
because then you've created more occasions

00:05:12.131 --> 00:05:14.106
to use the product and away you go.

00:05:14.106 --> 00:05:18.447
So I think it's the right thought.

00:05:18.447 --> 00:05:20.654
I think it's a farfetched dream

00:05:20.654 --> 00:05:23.440
to think that you can get
people to really think about it

00:05:23.440 --> 00:05:27.206
in a way that it's mandatory
to as many use cases

00:05:27.206 --> 00:05:29.848
as we do with food which is
really the holy grail of that

00:05:29.848 --> 00:05:31.473
but the interesting part of the question

00:05:31.473 --> 00:05:33.308
for everybody here is whatever you sell,

00:05:33.308 --> 00:05:34.712
whatever services you have,

00:05:34.712 --> 00:05:36.118
