00:06:01.570 --> 00:06:04.863
This, this used to be
something you wore, right?

00:06:04.863 --> 00:06:06.558
Like it was a functional item.

00:06:06.558 --> 00:06:08.577
You had tennis shoes, unbranded,

00:06:08.577 --> 00:06:09.623
and then over time people came along

00:06:09.623 --> 00:06:10.893
and started branding it

00:06:10.893 --> 00:06:14.057
and it went into a
fashion statement, right?

00:06:14.057 --> 00:06:16.542
And now it's a collector's item.

00:06:16.542 --> 00:06:18.495
There's a lot of sneakers being bought

00:06:18.495 --> 00:06:20.957
to put on a shelf and then trade.

00:06:20.957 --> 00:06:23.339
Now you've got the tennis sneaker

00:06:23.339 --> 00:06:26.285
in a 40 year window going
from just being a utility

00:06:26.285 --> 00:06:29.313
to play sports, or run, or what have you,

00:06:29.313 --> 00:06:31.726
to them being a fashion category play,

00:06:31.726 --> 00:06:33.863
and now a collector's category play.

00:06:33.863 --> 00:06:37.207
Three sections, hence why
we sell a lot more sneakers

00:06:37.207 --> 00:06:39.366
in society today than we used to.

00:06:39.366 --> 00:06:41.432
That's a real life example.

00:06:41.432 --> 00:06:42.733
That was good, I was happy with that.

00:06:42.733 --> 00:06:44.103
